   "he": "פֵּרְסוּ סָדִין שֶׁל בּוּץ. מַאי שְׁנָא שֶׁל בּוּץ? אָמַר רַב כָּהֲנָא: כְּדֵי שֶׁיַּכִּיר שֶׁעֲבוֹדַת הַיּוֹם בְּבִגְדֵי בוּץ.",
   "en": "§ It was stated in the mishna: «They spread» there «a sheet of fine linen.» The Gemara asks: «What is different» that the sheet that they spread was made of «fine linen? Rav Kahana said:» It was «so that» the High Priest «will be aware» and remember «that the service of the day» is performed «in fine linen.»"
  }
